{
"file": 1116,
"paths": [
"d009/d027/f051"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2a331c6b",
"en_raw": "About school"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "482627ad",
"en_raw": "shall we talk a bit?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "a6407df1",
"en_raw": "Sure..."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "9034b38f",
"en_raw": "Half relieved, half worried"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "d581ce2c",
"en_raw": "that's how I feel"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "6520f897",
"en_raw": "as your mother"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "e69b3b06",
"en_raw": "About today's parent conference?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "821e8112",
"en_raw": "No, lots of other things too"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "4bf27e48",
"en_raw": "Nao, you don't talk"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "c4495d0a",
"en_raw": "to me much, do you?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "65c6c9bf",
"en_raw": "I have nothing to talk about"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "b2548378",
"en_raw": "I try not to"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "07f9965f",
"en_raw": "stand out"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "ec0e5299",
"en_raw": "I like you, Nao"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "33037f02",
"en_raw": "It can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "06471d02",
"en_raw": "I'm your mother"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "e94e2a1e",
"en_raw": "But Nao, you"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "b7fad467",
"en_raw": "don't always"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "be11fe44",
"en_raw": "have to be a good boy"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "3ad05f01",
"en_raw": "just die like that"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "75a018ff",
"en_raw": "What are you getting at?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "4d86ed88",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5cb807ce",
"en_raw": "You're tough for my own child"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "acf2e7f8",
"en_raw": "What I mean, Mom"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "317612e6",
"en_raw": "I'd like to hear your honest thoughts sometimes"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "78afa7ce",
"en_raw": "Isn't there something"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "1a6c9ac8",
"en_raw": "you want to do yourself?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "e265242b",
"en_raw": "You'd probably get angry if I said"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "5e313b3a",
"en_raw": "I won't, I promise"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d60fcd06",
"en_raw": "No, there's nothing in particular"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "78b39f8c",
"en_raw": "for now"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "1b74a248",
"en_raw": "Thanks for the meal"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f9148b60",
"en_raw": "Nao, aren't you eating anymore?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "b4e50c6e",
"en_raw": "Yeah, just..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "3bab94b1",
"en_raw": "Fried white fish"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "3586090a",
"en_raw": "you didn't dislike it, did you?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "f10f0448",
"en_raw": "Or did something happen?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2a1c7387",
"en_raw": "Nope"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a6477521",
"en_raw": "It's not that"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "144d26ec",
"en_raw": "Maybe there are worries"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "052f3003",
"en_raw": "you can't tell Mom..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "8ac03cdb",
"en_raw": "Right, you're a middle schooler"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "2735d10e",
"en_raw": "But I'd like you"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "d4ecdef4",
"en_raw": "to eat properly"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "9ece5fd2",
"en_raw": "Worrying won't"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "2bf45a4a",
"en_raw": "do anything for you"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "20d5dee0",
"en_raw": "And either way"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "30a9599c",
"en_raw": "her life isn't in danger"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "cb37a128",
"en_raw": "Yeah, well, that's"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "0d115979",
"en_raw": "true but..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a9331aa1",
"en_raw": "She'll be fine tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "5e46f500",
"en_raw": "and show up"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "aa8bb759",
"en_raw": "Perfect attendance is"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "c35a54dc",
"en_raw": "her only merit"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "941f565a",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "941f565a",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "bc254e1e",
"en_raw": "Then..."
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "2a5b607c",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b57ec68a",
"en_raw": "What on earth happened..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "2ee76d65",
"en_raw": "That's cruel"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "bbe81368",
"en_raw": "Mom"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "d858ac60",
"en_raw": "Shall I contact the school?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "dc558114",
"en_raw": "...Someone did it to me?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "341824b4",
"en_raw": "I never said that"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "142e26da",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "e808a5fb",
"en_raw": "...It's okay, Mom"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "36a3527e",
"en_raw": "you don't have to do anything"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "ca0186ee",
"en_raw": "This is my..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "bfb14402",
"en_raw": "my own business..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "95b294c0",
"en_raw": "...Thanks for the meal"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "821a5e4c",
"en_raw": "Ah, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "89993c67",
"en_raw": "...Oh, it's just Nao"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "0a4d624e",
"en_raw": "Do you remember the rumor"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "8ed0de15",
"en_raw": "about the crow's curse?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "50119715",
"en_raw": "What's that, out of nowhere"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "eb1ffe78",
"en_raw": "No, um, I thought Sango"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "1382af02",
"en_raw": "might laugh at it"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "c412c6ad",
"en_raw": "...What's that supposed to be?"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b98d9ede",
"en_raw": "Something even worse"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "7cb852b3",
"en_raw": "I'd like to say to you but"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "7779d754",
"en_raw": "I'm not really in the mood"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "b01d1d06",
"en_raw": "so for now, with this"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "c2c8f862",
"en_raw": "will you put up with it?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "05bcd0ba",
"en_raw": "...Die!"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "379c1367",
"en_raw": "Then I'll hang up"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "79dba5e2",
"en_raw": "wait up"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "fe0a404b",
"en_raw": "Sango's been strange lately"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "b8e18bd9",
"en_raw": "Seems irritated"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "629aef7e",
"en_raw": "then suddenly spaced out..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "fd351663",
"en_raw": "Just say what you want"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "93c5c9e0",
"en_raw": "Um, about tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "c4743733",
"en_raw": "want to visit Shiina in the hospital?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "52593dfc",
"en_raw": "I'm home..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "3fbfbe68",
"en_raw": "Where's Dad...?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "406c137c",
"en_raw": "In his room"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "604301cc",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I today..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "10bcd342",
"en_raw": "You must be hungry"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "43ebb171",
"en_raw": "We already ate"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "79ab362e",
"en_raw": "I'll reheat yours, Nao"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "9ac8ef1c",
"en_raw": "That's sudden... I'm in trouble"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "7de8d9f3",
"en_raw": "The manuscript is stuck"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "5f8e20ff",
"en_raw": "and the rain is awful"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "17ecfa57",
"en_raw": "sorry, but you two"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "50dd0720",
"en_raw": "have fun on your own"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "91e696bd",
"en_raw": "...Did I sound a bit old-man-ish?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "64fbb706",
"en_raw": "Bye, then"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "49d7ff36",
"en_raw": "Wait, that's..."
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "960dbe60",
"en_raw": "The girl who came today"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "d578ad52",
"en_raw": "is she the one you walk the dog with?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "4e7b887c",
"en_raw": "A bit odd, but"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "87dd2937",
"en_raw": "she's cute"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "3e42262f",
"en_raw": "...Sango"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "859b25a5",
"en_raw": "Aren't you jealous?"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "82c52961",
"en_raw": "Sango doesn't care about me"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "85432dd3",
"en_raw": "Besides, she hates being"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "f9496c58",
"en_raw": "thought of as a girl"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "d2dda88b",
"en_raw": "Hm, was Sango"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "e78b6f2a",
"en_raw": "that kind of girl?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "e0740434",
"en_raw": "Sango, Sango"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "893a17e7",
"en_raw": "It's important!"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "29fda9d3",
"en_raw": "Don't laugh, listen"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "5a58cb2d",
"en_raw": "Why so excited..."
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "8c888fb6",
"en_raw": "Tomorrow is day 100!"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "c1050db1",
"en_raw": "of the curse..."
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "1f423cef",
"en_raw": "the last day of the crow's curse!"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "97f4fea7",
"en_raw": "What are you talking..."
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "27fbc6a3",
"en_raw": "Just listen"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "71236b87",
"en_raw": "Shiina collapsed today, right?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "7f600701",
"en_raw": "I counted just now"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "d2464630",
"en_raw": "the crow..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "d0b8f203",
"en_raw": "how many days passed"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "6832e84b",
"en_raw": "since that crow day"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "777fe76a",
"en_raw": "...So what does that have"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "689eb33d",
"en_raw": "to do with me?"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "9d041e1a",
"en_raw": "It was all the curse's fault!"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "2a5b607c",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "6b1e5bd3",
"en_raw": "She might die!"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "345a2a5d",
"en_raw": "So..."
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "41726d0a",
"en_raw": "I'm asking what that has"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "d3312a8c",
"en_raw": "to do with me!"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "ad8cfaf1",
"en_raw": "...Sango?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "b5a0647c",
"en_raw": "It's not like I owe"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "6ef13eb0",
"en_raw": "Kurumi Shiina anything"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "03f6747c",
"en_raw": "or was her friend"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "2b07d150",
"en_raw": "Besides"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "f47c9640",
"en_raw": "I'm busy now"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "65065d4d",
"en_raw": "Spare me from being dragged"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "2f160084",
"en_raw": "into stupid talk"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "b2553d14",
"en_raw": "...And Nao"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "a7c38fa1",
"en_raw": "it's about time you"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "fb09e747",
"en_raw": "woke up too"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "4f0e39fc",
"en_raw": "...What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "84c960fb",
"en_raw": "Face reality already"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "d1039689",
"en_raw": "that's what I mean!"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "ca302a66",
"en_raw": "Sango!!"
}
]
}